<%# Small print under the action. The caveats these messages carry, that the
    comment or the new date is not in the email, matter but they are not the
    point, so they sit below the button at a smaller size instead of taking a
    full paragraph above it. %>
<p class="ot-muted" style="margin:0 0 16px 0; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#6b7280;"><%= body %></p>
